02:24:32.970 --> 02:24:36.530
It's always good to have a little something tucked away when all his mana breaks loose.

02:24:38.250 --> 02:24:38.770
Empty.

02:24:43.060 --> 02:24:44.180
Someone's beaten us to it.

02:24:45.600 --> 02:24:46.080
But who?

02:24:46.480 --> 02:24:48.380
Crichton's too honorable.

02:24:49.740 --> 02:24:50.800
Baron's too dull.

02:24:51.480 --> 02:24:52.520
Dargo's too...

02:24:52.850 --> 02:24:53.990
Say it.

02:24:54.460 --> 02:24:54.980
Simple?

02:24:55.870 --> 02:24:57.030
Yeah, but he's not a thief.

02:24:57.190 --> 02:24:57.990
Somebody is.

02:24:58.560 --> 02:24:59.390
We've been robbed.

02:25:04.440 --> 02:25:04.980
How did you hear that?

02:25:05.570 --> 02:25:08.250
It sounded like tearing metal.

02:25:35.510 --> 02:25:37.900
I trust your wealth.

02:25:38.100 --> 02:25:40.060
I asked you for help.

02:25:40.370 --> 02:25:41.890
What the yachts were those creatures?

02:25:42.230 --> 02:25:42.950
They look like...

02:25:42.950 --> 02:25:43.810
They look like Armani.

02:25:45.260 --> 02:25:46.340
Armani's alive.

02:25:48.750 --> 02:25:50.330
You realize what that means?

02:25:50.790 --> 02:25:51.930
They're eating the ship.

02:25:52.190 --> 02:25:54.260
Yes, but we're poor.

02:26:33.130 --> 02:26:35.380
Howdy, Bakesh. Meet Winona.

02:26:35.900 --> 02:26:39.850
This comes off.

02:26:58.000 --> 02:26:59.970
I told you. I know...

02:27:00.000 --> 02:27:07.920
longer wear the gauntlet i'm not a creature of violence anymore that's good i don't believe you

02:27:07.920 --> 02:27:14.900
i don't care a lifetime of killing and extortion takes its toll yeah especially on those you kill

02:27:14.900 --> 02:27:24.580
and extort yes but also on myself during a hostage raid we captured a priest a disciple

02:27:24.580 --> 02:27:29.870
of the writ of taru he refused to eat or sleep all he would do day and night was preach

02:27:30.000 --> 02:27:31.440
whether anyone was listening or not.

02:27:33.060 --> 02:27:36.050
I executed him, but I kept his writ.

02:27:36.250 --> 02:27:36.990
I don't know why.

02:27:38.340 --> 02:27:39.800
One day I started reading it.

02:27:40.020 --> 02:27:42.510
They were words of peace, but they made me feel...

02:27:46.180 --> 02:27:48.840
And one day I took off my gauntlet and I threw it away.

02:27:50.140 --> 02:27:51.020
I still don't believe you.

02:27:51.200 --> 02:27:52.760
Well, then kill me or let me go.

02:27:54.420 --> 02:27:55.240
I need your gauntlet.

02:27:55.580 --> 02:27:57.110
No, it's a tool of destruction.

02:27:58.110 --> 02:27:58.870
That's why I want it.

02:28:03.000 --> 02:28:06.380
Well, how bad is it? Are we in danger of a hull breach?

02:28:06.680 --> 02:28:08.840
Of course we are. Those creatures eat metal.

02:28:09.570 --> 02:28:12.130
Zan, they're devouring Moya's sense filaments.

02:28:12.450 --> 02:28:14.810
She's trying to endure the pain, but it's growing.

02:28:15.000 --> 02:28:16.340
Brave, William.

02:28:16.600 --> 02:28:20.530
Don't you flush them out? Or suffocate them?

02:28:20.710 --> 02:28:23.890
I trapped several creatures in a bulkhead and opened it to space.

02:28:24.050 --> 02:28:29.700
But they were too firmly entrenched to expel, and the vacuum didn't affect them at all.

02:28:30.000 --> 02:28:30.840
Wow.

02:28:31.180 --> 02:28:32.180
Do something!

02:28:32.940 --> 02:28:36.180
I can't do any more until I have a specimen to study.

02:28:36.540 --> 02:28:37.880
Jan was trying to capture one.

02:28:38.020 --> 02:28:41.540
Now, if you can't make yourself useful, Rigel, I suggest you leave.

02:29:00.120 --> 02:29:01.040
This is your fault!

02:29:01.900 --> 02:29:02.820
My fault?

02:29:03.150 --> 02:29:03.970
My fault?

02:29:04.170 --> 02:29:05.530
This is your fault.

02:29:05.710 --> 02:29:07.010
You were on the inside.

02:29:07.070 --> 02:29:08.290
You stole the wrong container.

02:29:08.650 --> 02:29:10.230
With the device you gave me,

02:29:10.350 --> 02:29:12.500
I did precisely what I was supposed to.

02:29:12.640 --> 02:29:13.320
I was heroic.

02:29:13.700 --> 02:29:14.920
Shut up, both of you!

02:29:15.000 --> 02:29:17.860
The fault lies with all of us. We brought those creatures aboard.

02:29:18.200 --> 02:29:19.880
Moira is suffering because of us.

02:29:30.000 --> 02:29:31.200
Bring it here immediately.

02:29:31.372 --> 02:29:31.872
Ah!

02:29:32.876 --> 02:29:33.676
Soon as I can

02:29:38.700 --> 02:29:39.840
Attention, Sheyang vessel.

02:29:40.460 --> 02:29:42.020
This is not a hostile approach.

02:29:42.316 --> 02:29:44.096
I come with an opportunity for profit.

02:29:45.068 --> 02:29:45.848
Please respond.
